From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: UnlimitedBytes <admin@unlimitedbytes.ovh>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 20:14:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add multithreaded chunk and entity ticking infrastructure

- Create ConfettiChunkTicker for parallel chunk ticking via regions
- Create ConfettiEntityTicker for region-based entity ticking (infrastructure)
- Create LevelChunkRegion with entity/task management
- Create LevelChunkRegionMap for region tracking
- Create DelayedTask for scheduled task support
- Create Confetti utility class with runSync/ensureSync APIs
- Hook ChunkSystem to track ticking chunks in tickingRegions
- Hook EntityCallbacks to track ticking entities in tickingRegions
- Modify ServerChunkCache to use ConfettiChunkTicker
- Modify ServerLevel to compose chunk tick futures
- Modify MinecraftServer to wait for all world tick futures
- Add ConfettiRegionScheduler for region-locked task execution
- Add currentTickFuture fields for async tick tracking

